@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### A normal HTTP request receives 426 Upgrade Required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/live

### WebSocket handshake; subscribe frames are documented in README.md
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/live
Connection: Upgrade
Upgrade: websocket
Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13
Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==
